# Cloudflare Pages routing.
# /api/* is handled by Pages Functions (functions/api/...), which run before this file.
#
# Unknown routes are served by 404.html with a TRUE 404 status — Cloudflare Pages
# does this automatically when a 404.html exists. We deliberately no longer rewrite
# /*  ->  /index.html: that returned index.html with a 200 (a "soft 404"), which
# search engines treat as duplicate content. Clean URLs (/credential -> credential.html)
# continue to work natively without any rule here.
